{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/6afbfea334983981066e0c59c11bded8.avif?t=1763399600\" width=1560 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paradoxical is a first-person puzzle game about exploring impossible spaces through the power of portals. Walls, floors, and even entire rooms can connect in ways that break logic, letting you step from one place to another instantly, or into somewhere that shouldn\u2019t exist at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a42c39ddc01c690284ae57e9002b6e3f.poster.avif?t=1763399600\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a42c39ddc01c690284ae57e9002b6e3f.webm?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a42c39ddc01c690284ae57e9002b6e3f.mp4?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portals aren\u2019t just shortcuts; they twist space, reshape physics, and let you solve puzzles in ways that feel surprising and playful. You might drop an object through a portal to change its momentum, fold a corridor back onto itself, or watch as a doorway opens into an entirely new reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/3b309e28a4f5b53651276c957b73dd8b.poster.avif?t=1763399600\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/3b309e28a4f5b53651276c957b73dd8b.webm?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/3b309e28a4f5b53651276c957b73dd8b.mp4?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is designed to challenge how you think about space. Instead of relying on brute force or reflex, progress comes from looking differently, experimenting, and realizing the world isn\u2019t as rigid as it first appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/43471d97df1363a4ac6862456a130228.poster.avif?t=1763399600\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/43471d97df1363a4ac6862456a130228.webm?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/43471d97df1363a4ac6862456a130228.mp4?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environments are dreamlike and carefully crafted, mixing surreal architecture with striking visuals that pull you deeper into each space. As you explore, you\u2019ll discover not only clever solutions, but also a strange beauty hidden in the impossible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040750?t=1763399600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/729dd6d22e0ffbe857f289d3e77f2418ec5b88b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763399600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/0e8f8aeecf1b973b4103b8d9b900f6e882479666/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763399600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/0e8f8aeecf1b973b4103b8d9b900f6e882479666/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763399600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/6afbfea334983981066e0c59c11bded8.avif?t=1763399600\" width=1560 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paradoxical is a first-person puzzle game about exploring impossible spaces through the power of portals. Walls, floors, and even entire rooms can connect in ways that break logic, letting you step from one place to another instantly, or into somewhere that shouldn\u2019t exist at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a42c39ddc01c690284ae57e9002b6e3f.poster.avif?t=1763399600\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a42c39ddc01c690284ae57e9002b6e3f.webm?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a42c39ddc01c690284ae57e9002b6e3f.mp4?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portals aren\u2019t just shortcuts; they twist space, reshape physics, and let you solve puzzles in ways that feel surprising and playful. You might drop an object through a portal to change its momentum, fold a corridor back onto itself, or watch as a doorway opens into an entirely new reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/3b309e28a4f5b53651276c957b73dd8b.poster.avif?t=1763399600\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/3b309e28a4f5b53651276c957b73dd8b.webm?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/3b309e28a4f5b53651276c957b73dd8b.mp4?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is designed to challenge how you think about space. Instead of relying on brute force or reflex, progress comes from looking differently, experimenting, and realizing the world isn\u2019t as rigid as it first appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/43471d97df1363a4ac6862456a130228.poster.avif?t=1763399600\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/43471d97df1363a4ac6862456a130228.webm?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/43471d97df1363a4ac6862456a130228.mp4?t=1763399600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environments are dreamlike and carefully crafted, mixing surreal architecture with striking visuals that pull you deeper into each space. As you explore, you\u2019ll discover not only clever solutions, but also a strange beauty hidden in the impossible.</p>","developers":["gubebra"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/cf5e361512f06d038c75af70f691001647eca1b2/header.jpg?t=1763399600","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040750/846815039/9acb263f3db546b7653cb7376e45c3608158f153/1758655727/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758656849","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040750/846815039/9acb263f3db546b7653cb7376e45c3608158f153/1758655727/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758656849","highlight":true,"